      <h1 class="ed-title">How Much Does a Treadmill Stress Test Cost?</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        A plain exercise ECG stress test was listed at $331 to $774 as a prepaid cash price on MDsave, against a Medicare rate of $73.48 in a doctor's office in 2026. Add imaging and the price climbs: stress echo and nuclear tests cost several times more. Here is what each version costs, what insurance and Medicare leave you to pay, and how to get a real number before you book.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
